			"notes": "Nerdcraft ready feature pack.\n\n# ADDED FEATURES\n\n- Craftable bee nests and amethyst buds/crystal at different stages.\n- Potion stacking (including water bottles) (up to 16).\n- Craftable coral blocks from dead/alive corals/coral fans.\n- Smelt diorite to create calcite.\n- Weatherable copper blocks (and their variants) by right clicking via water bottle\n\n> Recipes can be seen using JEI type mods or the recipe book.\n\n# DIFFERENCES FROM LATEST UNCONTROLLED VERSION\n\n- From 1.2.0 feature set removed smelting andesite to gain tuff.\n\n> Voted off features are permanently removed from future updates unless revoted upon by the Nerdcraft comunity.\n\n<img width=\"320\" height=\"320\" alt=\"icon-export\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5bcf76e2-9d06-45a2-96f8-af8b0cf950dc\" />"
